# agent instruction files — the self CLI rewrites their managed block from the
# project's own conventions, which are internal operating rules (content and
# channel strategy, local scheduler jobs) and do not belong in a public repo.
# Contributor-facing guidance lives in README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and
# ARCHITECTURE.md, which stay tracked.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# local planning records — project state lives in the self store, not here;
